  "Une marque qui a des dizaines de contenus en circulation ne sait plus lesquels sont encore couverts. NeedCreator vous le dit, et vous relance avant l'échéance.": "A brand with dozens of pieces of content in circulation no longer knows which ones are still covered. NeedCreator tells you, and reminds you before the deadline.",
